<custom_item>
  type                     : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description              : "1.0224 - MSSRV - (L1) Ensure 'Create permanent shared objects' is set to 'No One'"
  info                     : "This user right is useful to kernel-mode components that extend the object namespace."
