<custom_item>
  type                     : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description              : "1.0299 - MSSRV - (L1) Ensure 'Audit: Force audit policy subcategory settings (Windows Vista or later) to override audit policy category settings' is set to 'Enabled'"
