<custom_item>
  type                     : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description              : "1.0166 - MSSRV - Ensure 'Audit insecure guest logon' is set to 'Enabled'"
  info                     : "This policy determines whether the Server Message Block (SMB) server will log events when the client is logged on as guest account."
